        dc:description          "!!MOTHBALLED!! Concepts from this collection have all been deprecated and replaced by equivalent P01 codes (follow the sameAs mapping link). Was previously defined as: Collection of terms used by the Ocean Biogeographic Information System to standardise attributes related to sampling instruments and methods.";
